fresh tools for spotting benchmark drift in live deployments. The top story today is the High 4 Preview release itself. Tencent released High 4 Preview as an open weight text only LLM. It carries 770 billion total parameters, and 49 billion active parameters in a mixture of expert setup. The context window reaches 1 million tokens, a substantial increase over the company's prior High 3 model from July.

