Now turning to model updates, an analysis examined 31,352 hourly benchmark scores across 49 model identifiers. Within day score variation measured 2.8 points. Between day variation reached 8.4 points, roughly three times larger. The study ran consistent coding, reasoning, and tool calling tasks inside Docker environments across five runs per task.

